{"headword":"צָמַח","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb.</strong> sprout, spring up <strong>(</strong>NH id., so 𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">צְמַח</span>; Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܨܡܰܚ</span> <em>spring</em> or <em>shine forth</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܨܶܡܚܳܐ</span> <em>shining</em>, also <em>sprout;</em> Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">צמח</span> <em>posterity</em><strong>)</strong>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">צָֽמַח־בּוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:37\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.37\">Lv 13:37</a>; 3 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְצָֽמְחוּ</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.4\">Is 44:4</a>; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִצְמַח</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 5:6\" href=\"/Job.5.6\">Jb 5:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Job 5:3\" href=\"/Job.5.3\">3</a> fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּצְמַחְנָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.9\">Is 42:9</a>, etc.; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">צֹמֵחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 10:5\" href=\"/Exodus.10.5\">Ex 10:5</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">צוֹמֵחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 2:6\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.2.6\">Ec 2:6</a>; fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">צֹמְחוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:6\" href=\"/Genesis.41.6\">Gn 41:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:23\" href=\"/Genesis.41.23\">23</a>;—<em>sprout, spring up:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"of plants, trees, etc. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:5\" href=\"/Genesis.2.5\">Gn 2:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 10:5\" href=\"/Exodus.10.5\">Ex 10:5</a> (both J), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:6\" href=\"/Genesis.41.6\">Gn 41:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:23\" href=\"/Genesis.41.23\">23</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 17:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.17.6\">Ez 17:6</a> (in fig.); once (late) <span dir=\"rtl\">יַעַר צוֹמֵחַ עֵצִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 2:6\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.2.6\">Ec 2:6</a> <em>wood sprouting with trees</em> (full of growing trees); fig. of future ruler (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, צֶ֫מַח\" href=\"/BDB,_צֶ֫מַח\", dir=\"rtl\">צֶמַח</a>) <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 6:12\" href=\"/Zechariah.6.12\">Zc 6:12</a>, posterity <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.4\">Is 44:4</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Job 8:19\" href=\"/Job.8.19\">Jb 8:19</a>, trouble <span dir=\"rtl\">(עָמָל)</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 5:6\" href=\"/Job.5.6\">5:6</a>, truth <span dir=\"rtl\">(אֱמֶת)</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 85:12\" href=\"/Psalms.85.12\">ψ 85:12</a>, restoration <span dir=\"rtl\">(אֲרֻכָֽתְךָ)</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 58:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.58.8\">Is 58:8</a>, future events <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.9\">Is 42:9</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"of hair <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 13:37\" href=\"/Leviticus.13.37\">Lv 13:37</a> (P; cf. <strong>Pi.</strong>)."}],"num":"2."}],"form":"Qal"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>grow abundantly</em>, always of hair;—Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">צִמֵּחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.7\">Ez 16:7</a> (in fig.): Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִצַמַּח</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 10:5\" href=\"/II_Samuel.10.5\">2 S 10:5</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 19:5\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.19.5\">1 Ch 19:5</a> (of beard); Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְצַמֵּחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 16:22\" href=\"/Judges.16.22\">Ju 16:22</a> (Samson’s hair)."}],"form":"Pi."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 ms. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְהִצְמִיחָהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 55:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.55.10\">Is 55:10</a>; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַצְמִיחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:5\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.5\">2 S 23:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 61:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.61.11\">Is 61:11</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיַּצְמַח</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:9\" href=\"/Genesis.2.9\">Gn 2:9</a>, etc.; Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְהַצְמִיחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 38:27\" href=\"/Job.38.27\">Jb 38:27</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַצְמִיחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:14\" href=\"/Psalms.104.14\">ψ 104:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 147:8\" href=\"/Psalms.147.8\">147:8</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>cause to grow</em>, c. acc. of plant, subj. <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 2:9\" href=\"/Genesis.2.9\">Gn 2:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:14\" href=\"/Psalms.104.14\">ψ 104:14</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Job 38:27\" href=\"/Job.38.27\">Jb 38:27</a>, c. 2 acc. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 147:8\" href=\"/Psalms.147.8\">ψ 147:8</a> <em>who causeth mts. to sprout grass;</em> fig., obj. <span dir=\"rtl\">צֶמַח צְדָקָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 33:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.33.15\">Je 33:15</a>; <em>horn</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">(קֶרֶן)</span> of Isr. <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 29:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.29.21\">Ez 29:21</a>, of David <a data-ref=\"Psalms 132:17\" href=\"/Psalms.132.17\">ψ 132:17</a>; righteousness, etc. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 61:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.61.11\">Is 61:11b</a>; cf. also <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 23:5\" href=\"/II_Samuel.23.5\">2 S 23:5</a> (if interrog., v. Dr Bu; otherwise HPS); subj. ground <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:18\" href=\"/Genesis.3.18\">Gn 3:18</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 61:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.61.11\">Is 61:11a</a> (sim.), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 29:22\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.29.22\">Dt 29:22</a> (obj. om.); also (fig.) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 45:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.45.8\">Is 45:8</a> (cf. Di Kit)."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"of rain, <em>cause</em> the earth <em>to sprout</em> (abs.), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 55:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.55.10\">Is 55:10</a>."}],"num":"2."}],"form":"Hiph."}]},"rid":"BDB08441","strong_numbers":["6779"],"next_hw":"צֶ֫מַח","prev_hw":"צַמָּה","all_cited":true,"root":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["7541"],"TWOT":["1928"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}